Package: policy-engine-web
Version: 0.1.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Dufferin Software <support@dufferinsw.com>
Installed-Size: 390
Depends: policy-engine (>= 0.1.0)
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/dufferinsw/policy_engine
Description: Web UI for the XDP policy engine
 A React/TypeScript web interface for managing the XDP policy-based
 packet processing engine. Provides a dashboard for monitoring,
 interface management, policy rules editing, and statistics.
 .
 Static web assets are installed to /usr/share/policy-engine-web and
 served directly by the policy-engine backend.
